{"server":"tw","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_07_end","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_07","title":"制動失靈","storyCode":"RS-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"061716b0000ce896a12590e80aa6c4720c4a3666fff2ad7fe7c712afeca174d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"耶拉岡德顯靈，請“灰禮帽”離開，“灰禮帽”決定改變探查的方式。營火晚會上，“灰禮帽”將蒐集的線索交給子爵，子爵返回軍營，隨後令部下換上實彈。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g9_underkjerastastue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算在這裡坐到什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經發現了這裡，遲早會來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他來了，你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺害外國使節可是重罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你不是謝拉格人，卻願意為謝拉格做這麼多事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯的野心，也是“為了謝拉格”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了今天，誰還能否認，他即使有自己的野心，這份野心裡也包含了“為了謝拉格”的部分呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這大概是他最不願意聽到的讚美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒回答我的問題呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當恩希歐迪斯和我提到耶拉岡德或許確實存在時，我想過或許有一天，我可以和所謂的神明交手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來是沒指望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，恩希歐迪斯已經沒這個打算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他有這個打算，你真的會對抗可能真實存在的耶拉岡德嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，只有雪崩的時候才能找些刺激，如果真有這樣的機會，我可以嘗試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你會贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，即使是對抗雪崩，我也從沒贏過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，你享受的是挑戰的過程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而正發生在這片土地上的事情，你覺得是值得你挑戰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒你想的那麼偉大，我是這麼長大的，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這句話真不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，鐧小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的戰場不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是聖女的意思，恕我難以從命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的戰場，由我自己選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說，這是耶拉岡德的意思呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那麼，為什麼由你來傳達耶拉岡德的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是聖女大人的侍女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，聖女的意思，就是耶拉岡德的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，耶拉岡德會支持聖女大人的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果黑騎士不是個蠢人，那麼，比起四處追我，她一定會守在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道我會回來，就像我也知道我會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但願我能活著回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我早一些猜到問題的中心在這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我猜不到。又有誰能想到，恩希歐迪斯膽子大到敢把一國之信仰當作自己野心的幌子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是被公爵閣下投資的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那位聖女，她對這一切真的一點都不了解嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道，她真的能容忍到這種地步？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……石頭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"來者所為何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只是一名虔誠的信徒，為了在近處瞻仰神的面貌而來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祂累了，今天祂想要休息。\n明天再來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說耶拉岡德歡迎外來者的信仰，難道這只是一句戲言？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虔誠之人不必自證，不誠之人口舌無用。\n祂說，你今日不可再向前一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若我非要向前呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰禮帽”環視四周，這裡是銀心湖邊的主幹道，平時就非常熱鬧，而他的突然出現，引起了許多人的注意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他猛地打了自己一巴掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那個人什麼時候出現在那裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看，他忽然打自己巴掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不會瘋了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰禮帽”沒有理會周圍的人，只是轉身面向耶拉岡德像的方向，學著那些虔誠的信徒一般，做了一個祈禱的動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德保佑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是他踏上這片土地之後，第一次做這件事。\n然後，他轉身離開，沒有片刻猶豫。\n他並沒有注意到，不遠處，一雙眼睛也在看著他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧不是多嘴的人，應該不會把這件事告訴恩雅吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我做的也不算過分吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就說了，要當旁觀者可是很難的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她嘆了口氣，轉過身，像是一個在抱怨妹妹提的要求有些棘手的姐姐一般，瞬息融入人海之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，長官，你好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，今天晚上銀心湖邊不是要舉辦一場小型晚會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來取酒的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實收到過這樣的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來，我需要跟那邊確認一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"站在這裡別動，你搜一下他的身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，我只是個送酒的，有必要這樣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊時期，見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你說的都是真的，我們再跟你道歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，恐怕兩位不用跟我道歉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒商按下腰間的一個裝置，室內的攝影機突然開始不自然地轉動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼A","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"咕……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"有敵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼B","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩名山雪鬼倒下後，酒商迅速來到終端機前進行一番操作。\n隨著他的操作，角落的幾個攝影機在短暫停頓後，又恢復正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事先調查過了，謝拉格採購的是上一代的作業系統，那兩個漏洞可是很致命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推薦你們購買下一代產品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果謝拉格願意成為維多利亞的一部分，那就可以免費獲得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒商鬆了口氣，但是，他立刻彎下了腰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——我的傷口要裂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑騎士的破壞力，果然不是開玩笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，黑騎士畢竟做不到全知全能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於耶拉岡德……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說吧。至少祂沒有阻止我找到這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒商重新站起身子，緩步走向附近的酒桶。\n酒桶很重，但是，當他湊近後，立刻察覺到，空氣中並沒有酒的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒桶中存放的，根本不是酒，而是金屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我調查過謝拉格的金屬採購量，當時並沒有從中看出問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果說，用來建造雕像的金屬，並沒有全都被用來建造雕像……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，剩下的金屬去了哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些酒桶裡的金屬，接下來又會去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，我就說，黑騎士的力氣雖然恐怖，應該也不至於到削鐵如泥的地步，原來如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他立刻轉身回到終端前操作。\n隨著他在鍵盤上的不斷敲擊，一張張圖表在螢幕上不斷彈出。\n一會兒，他終於站起身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離晚會還有幾個小時——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我看一看吧，恩希歐迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的愚蠢到想要對抗維多利亞嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g7_lakescenery_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，你見到了你的父親，然後給了他一腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，超解氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然一開始我也沒有很生氣，但是，我一看到他想擺出父親的樣子我就忽然很想踹他一腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，幹得好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，我剛來謝拉格的時候和阿克托斯族長也有過一面之緣，只是後面就沒遇見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我能記清楚他的長相的話，你就不會走這麼多彎路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你說實話，我真的長得跟他挺像的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，仔細想想，他蓄的那把鬍子……就算我昨天和阿克托斯族長喝過酒，也沒有那麼容易認出來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就說嘛，那樣子哪裡像美男子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許……剃掉鬍子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼都沒說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，你看，那邊好多馱獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，附近的村民們也都來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必這會是一個美好的夜晚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有馱獸在頂你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉，這不是莉莉嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這孩子，看到你就跑過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，這就是你說的莉莉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她是我來到謝拉格遇到的第一隻馱獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是我在這裡交到的最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我的小可愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（粗獷的鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我可以摸摸她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，莉莉很親人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（親暱的鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她中意你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，羅莎琳，你果然是有謝拉格的血脈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，她在舔我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想坐到她的身上去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，對吧，老雷昂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，去吧，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好欸，大叔，扶我一把！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住我的手，一、二、三——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮的鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，莉莉真的好穩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟著莉莉去逛一逛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，真是個活潑的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是嗎，我女兒小時候也這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上好的乳酪，今天才做出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你快要回去了吧，特意給你做了一塊，尋思今晚應該能遇到你，就給帶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼好意思，你家的乳酪可是要賣錢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼不好意思的，你也幫我的家人和馱獸看過許多次病了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說的話，還是我欠你醫藥費呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就把這塊乳酪當醫藥費吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好啊，好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有比這更好的離別禮物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，一開始，我們都還是提防著你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這一個月相處下來，都當你是好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷感的話我就不說了，你下次來的時候，可別忘了來我的牧場做客啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定，一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷昂叔叔，你也認識子爵閣下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是聖女大人嗎，是啊，老哈洛德現在在我們村子裡可是大紅人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，希望你和你的馱獸們都能玩得開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，能見到聖女大人我已經很開心啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一場歡慶的晚會啊，聖女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然明天的儀式才是重頭戲，但是普通民眾只能透過媒體轉播觀看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才特意籌備了這樣一場晚會，為的就是讓所有民眾都享受到這種節日的氛圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是聖女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位“灰禮帽”閣下呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許他這個人比較陰暗，不太喜歡熱鬧的地方吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我確實不太喜歡熱鬧的地方，但是這和個性可沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格的風光太好，一時忘了時間，聖女大人見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能喜歡謝拉格的風景自然再好不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜，希望您也能享受這場晚會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我帶了酒，哈洛德，你這位朋友喝酒嗎？一起喝一點吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰禮帽”向哈洛德隱蔽地遞了個手勢。\n那是軍隊中的手勢，意思是迴避。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，老雷昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒可能要等一等了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高昂的鳴叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被他穿著黑色衣服朋友喊走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“約翰”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下，希望您在今晚的宴會上玩得還算開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在被你叫走之前，我確實還挺開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，因為接下來，您會不開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湖心島的耶拉岡德像，在那底下有一些秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍人討厭秘密這個詞，“約翰史密斯”先生，為我們解開它，正是你們的工作，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，我無法解開它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不像“灰禮帽”會說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我受到了一些阻擋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我是不是可以理解為，你失敗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我無法探明那裡面究竟有什麼，但是，在那裡受到阻擋本身，就足以證明我的方向是正確的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰禮帽”從懷中掏出一疊東西，裡面有的是照片，有的是文檔，有的是筆記。\n哈洛德拿起其中的一些看了兩眼，馬上，剛才的笑容就凝固在了臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運酒的車廂中裝載的貨物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"異鐵的實際流向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運輸路線的規劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的情報都指向一個事實——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在湖心島的地下，一定隱藏著恩希歐迪斯……不，是這個國家最不可告人的秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g7_lakescenery_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓一名謝拉格政要的女兒聽到這些話可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個軍人，我只管打仗。這是你們情報人員該關心的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在之前，連自己是誰的女兒都不清楚，又能做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能讓她認清這個國家的狀況早點離開，或許也不是一件壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣她就只是一位烏薩斯國民了。我可不敢得罪烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我發現，我之前對你或許有些誤判，“灰禮帽”閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼此彼此，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這樣的人，互相提防著點，對彼此都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一句大實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句實話你愛聽，下一句就未必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不能空手回去的，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你真的明白。這是恩希歐迪斯欠公爵閣下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他越界了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這樣說服自己的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該比我更擅長這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g7_lakescenery_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"宴會還在繼續著。\n人們圍在營火旁載歌載舞，迎接即將到來的明天。\n在他們的腦海中，明天一定是光明的，喜慶的，歡騰的，令人發自內心想要起舞高歌的。\n哈洛德想，大概只有自己沒有辦法這麼想了。\n他忽然感覺有點冷。\n他上一次感覺冷的時候，是剛來到這片土地的時候。\n他覺得自己需要一瓶酒，或者不只一瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德，我等了你半天了，嗝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再不來，酒我都要喝完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，看我，有好酒怎麼少得了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來來來，今晚，我們不醉不歸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"他有點忘了自己到底做了什麼了。\n也許是在營火旁跳起了家鄉的舞蹈？也許是抓著一個倒楣蛋和他一起唱謝拉格的民歌？\n對了，他好像還和一根欄桿認真地探討了一下謝拉格的獸醫技術。\n他是怎麼出來的來著？\n算了，誰知道呢。\n反正，回去的路他是記得的。\n從宴會場地回軍營有一段不小的距離。\n他首先要沿著湖邊的走道回到中心大道上。沿途，他會遇到許多飯後散步的老人，也會看到在冰面上玩耍的孩童。\n從這裡可以看到遠處的耶拉岡德像，道路的旁邊也設立了專門的觀景點，總是會有人聚集在那裡，或是向耶拉岡德禱告，或是自拍。\n兩種截然不同的生活方式有的時候會發生衝突，但更多時候是以一種和諧的方式共存著，就像這片土地上的許多事物一樣。\n接著，他要穿過日益繁華的中心大道，他清楚地記得，已經有好幾家店和他剛抵達謝拉格時不一樣了。\n在這條街道接近中間的一條小巷子裡，有一間他最近很喜歡去的餐廳。\n餐廳的菜餚很好地融合了維多利亞風格與謝拉格風格，他很喜歡。\n餐廳的主人是一對年輕的夫婦，女主人是謝拉格人，她在維多利亞學習廚藝時遇到了自己的愛人。\n兩個人組成了家庭，然後返回謝拉格經營起了這家小店，希望在這片欣欣向榮的土地上找到更好的生活。\n然後，他要走過一條還沒有修建完成的公路，穿過一片樹林，在那個能夠俯瞰這片土地的山坡上，有為他生起的火爐。\n從大路的邊緣踏入鬆軟泥土中的瞬間，他能清楚地意識到這個國家距離發達還有相當一段距離。\n但是，在樹林間行走的靜謐感隨即會蓋過這種想法。\n雖然和老兄弟們在一起的時候還是會吵吵鬧鬧的，但是，他最近越來越常回想起孩童的時候。\n晚風拂過金色的麥田，少年的他在裡面忘情地奔跑，彷彿沒有任何煩惱——\n不，就是沒有任何煩惱。\n當他走過雪地時，當那種靜謐感將他籠罩住時，他會意識到，他不再年輕了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g5_victoriabarracks_c"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，好重的酒味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老大，又去哪裡瀟灑了，喝酒不帶上兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快看，老大！快看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那該死的馱獸盲盒，除了隱藏款我們都湊齊三套了，這是不是喀蘭貿易的陰謀啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他走向房間深處拿起遙控器，不斷變換著投影機的內容。\n每一張都是與謝拉格有關的情報，可能的行軍路線，軍事基地的位置，崗哨的分布，山雪鬼相關的調查——\n在他抵達謝拉格的一週內，這些情報就已經被整理完成放在了他的面前，但他一遍又一遍地要求自己遺忘這些東西。\n以至於大部分內容他反而背下來了。\n他丟開遙控器，抓過手邊的折疊躺椅，展開它，把自己埋入其中，閉上眼。\n比起地圖和沙盤，他更喜歡聽著積雪從樹枝上抖落時的簌簌聲，這會讓他回想起麥浪發出的聲響——\n沙沙，沙沙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老大？怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別管他，估計喝醉了。繼續說剛才的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說萊塔尼亞要多一座新城了，主打一個對外貿易，你看看這優惠政策，是不是划算瘋了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"但現實總是事與願違。\n就像他的父親永遠會嚴厲地要求他離開麥田，回家繼續他的訓練。\n就像煙斗柄不知何時缺了一截。\n就像他斷掉的腿再也回不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嬉鬧聲漸小，他的士兵們齊齊看向他。\n他的士兵們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人換上實彈，待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天清晨開始行動，目標是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聲音有些沙啞。\n麥浪聲停止了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
